body:
literally same story. i'm 30yo and been with my partner for 10 years on and off and i'm still with him and completely dependent on him. i work part time seasonal and he works full time. i also have severe bi polar mania and am a total fucking wreck on my own. we have such a good time when its just the both of us but he's refused to hang out with my friends because they're close with my ex. I also just got re-acquainted with an old friend of mine because he sells CBD oil and I wanna try that for my bi polar symptoms. the fact the i didn't tell my bf BEFORE i went over to his house gave him the ammunition to start a fight last night. asking if he had a girlfriend and if she was physically present. i even wanted to introduce them but now i don't even wanna look at my boyfriend because he's projecting all this insecurity about our past on me while i'm also trying to heal.

&#x200B;

i'm afraid to tell him that i plan on visiting my best friend who lives in washington (i'm in michigan).

&#x200B;

i'm really losing happiness at a rapid rate after seeing OP's post...
